---
// spec: S05 (/board/12th)
import BoardClassPage from '../../components/BoardClassPage.astro';
---
<BoardClassPage
  cls="12th"
  heading="12th class (second year) test paper"
  intro="Inter part 2 ke final ke liye apne mazmoon aur chapters ka board pattern paper."
  subjects={['English', 'Urdu', 'Pakistan Studies', 'Physics', 'Chemistry', 'Biology', 'Maths', 'Computer Science', 'Statistics', 'Accounting', 'Economics', 'Banking']}
  faq={[
    { q: 'Final se pehle kitne papers karun?', a: 'Har mazmoon ke kam az kam do teen poore papers waqt laga kar karein, aur us se pehle chhote chapter-war papers.' },
    { q: 'Improvement ke imtihan ke liye bhi?', a: 'Haan. Jis mazmoon ka paper chahiye, us ka naam aur chapters likh dein.' },
    { q: 'Kya first year ke chapters mila sakte hain?', a: 'Haan, chapters ke khane mein saaf likh dein ke kaun se first year aur kaun se second year ke hain.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="paper-heading">Second year: final aur aage ka rasta</h2>
  <p class="mt-3">
    12th class inter ka aakhri saal hai. Is ke number university admission, merit aur kai jobs ke liye bhi dekhe jate hain, is liye
    is saal ki tayyari ka asar door tak jata hai. Second year ke syllabus ke sath bohat se students ko first year ki dohrai bhi
    karni hoti hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Board ke paper mein objective MCQs, short sawal aur long sawal hote hain. Long sawal mein tarteeb se likha hua jawab, saaf
    headings aur jahan zaroorat ho wahan diagram ya formula number dilata hai. Waqt ki taqseem sab se bara masla hota hai, is liye
    poore paper waqt laga kar hal karna zaroori hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Pehle chapter-war chhote papers banwayen, phir send-up se pehle poore syllabus ke. Har paper ke baad dekhein ke kahan number
    kate: kya jawab ghalat tha, adhoora tha, ya waqt kam par gaya. Agle paper mein usi kamzori par kaam karein.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Teachers aur academies send-up aur pre-board tests ke liye bhi yeh paper le sakte hain. Order mein mazmoon, chapters aur kul
    number likhein; class pehle se 12th chuni hui hai. Date sheet aur result ke liye apne board ki official website dekhein.
  </p>
</BoardClassPage>
